# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Camzify website — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in the value. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# There is exactly ONE environment variable. If you add a `process.env.X` anywhere,
# add it here too — this file is the only inventory of what the app needs.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Database ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string. Backs the four lead-capture tables in
# prisma/schema.prisma (demo requests, contact, free trial, newsletter).
#
# NOT needed to run or build the site — all 121 pages are static and
# `prisma generate` does not require a live connection. Only the four /api/*
# form endpoints use it; without it they return {"success": false} and every
# page still renders normally.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DATABASE?schema=public"
